    "detailed_description": "<h1>CHECK OUT MY NEW GAME &lt;3</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>This is a challenging rock climbing game where you control a two-headed creature that jumps and clings.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778740/extras/ec6a9801f8f91ffb5cdf204c18518a99.poster.avif?t=1752253003\" width=628 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778740/extras/ec6a9801f8f91ffb5cdf204c18518a99.webm?t=1752253003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778740/extras/ec6a9801f8f91ffb5cdf204c18518a99.mp4?t=1752253003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Play?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Stay calm.<br></li><li>Aim for the rock where you want to land.<br></li><li>Hold the button and release to jump.<br></li><li>Rotate in the air for better alignment.<br></li><li>Avoid hitting your second head to prevent bouncing.<br></li><li>If you miss, take a moment and listen to the relaxing mountain sounds, then return to the first step.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778740/extras/ad24233e7677423cc60ba0a7313b9b1b.poster.avif?t=1752253003\" width=628 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778740/extras/ad24233e7677423cc60ba0a7313b9b1b.webm?t=1752253003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778740/extras/ad24233e7677423cc60ba0a7313b9b1b.mp4?t=1752253003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thank You for Playing!</h2>If you enjoy the game and have suggestions for improvement, please feel free to share.",
